1
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:17,050
The rules keep changing.

2
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:25,890
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

3
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:36,330
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

4
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:44,970
I am resolved to sever this flood

5
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:51,330
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

6
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:55,690
from loneliness and distinction.

7
00:00:55,920 --> 00:01:00,650
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:05,650
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,850
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:11,490
Chase !

11
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,690
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,610
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,650
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:27,490
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:29,850
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:34,290
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,930
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,490
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:47,810
What is there to fear ?

20
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,160
Such a thick death aura !

21
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,840
Senior Zhou Yi !

22
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,200
How can Ling Tianhou's sword formation

23
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,760
have demonic energy ?

24
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,240
Senior !

25
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,520
Wake up !

26
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,000
Senior,

27
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,360
still not waking up !?

28
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,280
Scram.

29
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,520
I thought that

30
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,400
Senior had decided to just watch the fight.

31
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,080
On the path to immortality,

32
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,640
there are many who deceive

33
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:13,120
and far too few who treat others with sincerity.

34
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,240
I didn't expect you to come.

35
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,920
You

36
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:18,040
should leave.

37
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:22,600
I initially thought you were just trapped here

38
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:25,040
but your body emanates a thick death aura.

39
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,560
Although that demonic energy is strange,

40
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,520
as the Rain Sword Spirit,

41
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,800
you shouldn't be in such a state.

42
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,720
Unless...

43
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,400
you don't want to live anymore.

44
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:42,000
Ling Tianhou trapped me

45
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,720
and plotted for the celestial swords

46
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,280
in the pursuit of strength.

47
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:49,040
The Water Demon Spirit worked with him

48
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:51,240
to seize my body

49
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,280
in order to survive.

50
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,200
But I...

51
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,200
She is already gone...

52
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,320
What else could I possibly seek ?

53
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,170
Your heart is already dead,

54
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,120
I indeed shouldn’t have come.

55
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,600
Wang Lin,

56
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,520
I'm sorry.

57
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,480
I have fulfilled my promise to guard this pagoda.

58
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:20,280
I give this pagoda back to you.

59
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,120
Ting'er...

60
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,840
Her name is not Ting'er.

61
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,800
If my guess is correct,

62
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,280
her true name

63
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,040
is Qing Shuang.

64
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,480
Qing Shuang ?

65
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,680
Qing Shuang

66
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:44,970
is the daughter of Celestial Emperor Qing Lin, the strongest person in the Celestial Realm.

67
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,640
And from what I know,

68
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:50,720
Qing Lin is very likely recovering in a cave somewhere in this Demon Spirit Land.

69
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,720
Ting'er...

70
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,440
If her father is really here,

71
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,720
there must be a way to bring Ting'er back to life !

72
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,920
Wang Lin,

73
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,880
are you certain ?

74
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:06,560
It depends on whether you want to gamble on this chance.

75
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,680
Scatter for me !

76
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,760
If I hadn't accepted to be imprisoned,

77
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,810
do you think a mere strand of Ling Tianhou's Divine Sense

78
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,120
is worthy

79
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,240
of stopping me !?

80
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,200
Let's leave !

81
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:18,050
My Sword Spirit body makes it difficult to store items.

82
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,810
Wang Lin,

83
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,040
please keep it safe.

84
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,280
I remember that,

85
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:25,240
there were 2 Celestial Swords inside the pagoda.

86
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,480
Is the other one

87
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,880
still with you ?

88
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,560
Yes.

89
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,510
Ah !

90
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,890
Senior, please spare my life !

91
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:35,000
This little one didn't know the sword had an owner !

92
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,600
If it wasn't for that fiend's orders,

93
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:39,160
I wouldn't have dared to claim it !

94
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:46,040
This Sword Spirit of yours is quite interesting.

95
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,640
Wang Lin,

96
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:50,920
although I can't pass the Celestial Sword's abilities to you,

97
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:54,680
I can let your Sword Spirit comprehend my ancient sword intent

98
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,200
to allow him to fully control the Celestial Sword.

99
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,760
Ancient sword intent ?

100
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,160
Master !

101
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:31,000
Your Sword Spirit has a rebellious nature.

102
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,680
It must have caused you plenty of trouble over the years.

103
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:41,040
From now on, you won't have to worry about it anymore.

104
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:44,280
I have left a mark within its consciousness.

105
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,520
If it dares to betray you in the future,

106
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:49,400
it will die from the backlash of the inheritance.

107
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,280
Thank you, Senior.

108
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,520
If you want to thank me,

109
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,240
it's still a bit too early.

110
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:08,960
Break !

111
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,840
Senior Zhou Yi !

112
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,410
You...

113
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,520
From now on,

114
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,160
this sword

115
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:22,240
fully belongs to you.

116
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,040
Henceforth,

117
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,560
even its original Sword Spirit

118
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:29,760
is no longer allowed to control this sword.

119
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:30,920
Senior...

120
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,080
This gift

121
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,440
is too much.

122
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,720
I am doing this for my own selfish reasons.

123
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,240
Wang Lin,

124
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,320
I just want one thing.

125
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,520
Help me find Ting'er's father.

126
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:44,960
Sure.

127
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,760
If Ting'er can wake up,

128
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,170
whether it's an inheritance

129
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,840
or a celestial sword,

130
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:55,720
none of them matter.

131
00:09:56,720 --> 00:10:00,520
I know that seeking the traces of the Celestial Emperor will not be easy.

132
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,880
Wang Lin,

133
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:05,240
I have one more opportunity for you.

134
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,120
If my senses are correct,

135
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:10,400
the previous generation's Rain Sword Spirit

136
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:13,240
is at the bottom of the Tide Abyss.

137
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:14,960
Come.

138
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:19,290
Bottom of the Tide Abyss

139
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:24,240
The tides of the East Demon Sea

140
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,160
likely originate from here.

141
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:29,800
I wonder how terrifying the power of the tide is

142
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,760
when it erupts every 500 years.

143
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,120
Be careful !

144
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:44,250
This purple mist can actually swallow Divine Sense !

145
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,920
This mist is too weird

146
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,170
for you to handle.

147
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,200
Get on !

148
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,610
Calm your breath and focus your mind.

149
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,000
Stabilize your energy,

150
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,290
don't let celestial spiritual energy escape.

151
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,200
Go !

152
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:01,800
Break !

153
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:02,880
Disperse !

154
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,160
Go !

155
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,040
Is the power of this Celestial Sword to your liking ?

156
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,440
It's excellent.

157
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,840
In that case,

158
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,970
I'm looking forward to that Sword Spirit even more !

159
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,520
Good !

160
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,760
Then hold tight !

161
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,650
We're almost there.

162
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:25,080
The Rain Sword Spirit !

163
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:36,760
Senior !

164
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,960
Senior !

165
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,640
Underworld...

166
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,680
River !

167
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,880
Go down...

168
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,050
Who is it !?

169
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,400
Go down...

170
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:45,240
Go down...

171
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,920
Wang Lin,

172
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:50,010
focus your mind and guard your heart !

173
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,000
This Tide Abyss is truly treacherous.

174
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,880
I nearly fell for it.

175
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,880
The person in that scroll

176
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,600
kept telling me to go down.

177
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,640
I wonder what exactly

178
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,120
lies at the bottom of the abyss.

179
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,370
Previous generation's
Wealth Sword

180
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,680
When I entered the Heng Yue Sect,

181
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:32,490
This should have been in episode 1 but was cut.

182
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:26,160
I saw an identical sword in the Treasure Pavilion.

183
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,640
I suppose it was a replica...

184
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,280
It's been almost a thousand years.

185
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,440
The cultivation road is truly unpredictable,

186
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:35,080
and karma is unfathomable.

187
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,010
Wang Lin,

188
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,640
This place is weird.

189
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,920
The mist is getting denser.

190
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:45,320
This divine sense will lead to the formation I set at the exit.

191
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,400
Senior can just follow it.

192
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:55,730
Cloud Celestial Cave
Fire Demon Country

193
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:57,920
Juan'er,

194
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,040
it's time to come out of seclusion.

195
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,450
What a wonderful Dao Couple !

196
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,240
I'm so envious !

197
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,160
Indeed !

198
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,690
Wang Wei
Cloud Celestial Couple
Nirvana Shatter

199
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,690
Hu Juan
Cloud Celestial Couple
Nirvana Shatter

200
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:19,840
That is...

201
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:20,320
This...

202
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,930
This is the descent of a Celestial Lord !

203
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,600
They actually left their cave !

204
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:34,760
I must speed up the devouring process.

205
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,320
Interesting.

206
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,680
This restriction is pretty clever.

207
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:05,680
It's a mix of ancient restrictions

208
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:08,280
with a hint of celestial restrictions.

209
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,640
Falseness

210
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,240
within truth.

211
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,840
To reach such a realm

212
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,760
one must have experienced both life and death,

213
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:21,490
and begun to comprehend the Dao,

214
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:23,600
even just a fraction of it.

215
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:28,240
To possess such a profound heart,

216
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:31,360
this person must be at least 10 000 years old.

217
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,640
I wouldn't be so sure.

218
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,560
Juan'er,

219
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:38,680
I'll make a bet with you.

220
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,440
If this person has cultivated for less than 10 000 years,

221
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,080
then I lose.

222
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,320
What do you say ?

223
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:48,080
Dear, you must know that

224
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,120
gambling

225
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:51,000
is the best way to lose.

226
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:54,200
If you are greedy, you'll end up with nothing.

227
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:56,440
Your words are sharp.

228
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:58,280
Are you talking about me

229
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,280
or about Greed ?

230
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:02,600
Greed is insatiable.

231
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,280
His audacity is boundless.

232
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:07,210
He has repeatedly snuck into the Tide Abyss to investigate,

233
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,960
thinking he was invincible.

234
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,840
Little does he know that his movements

235
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:14,520
have long fallen within our calculations.

236
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,840
This man has likely developed an interest

237
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,760
for that token in the tide.

238
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,080
Senior Brother,

239
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,920
are you alright ?

240
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,600
It's nothing.

241
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:38,120
This king beast really is something.

242
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:39,440
If not for it,

243
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,920
how could we have been trapped here for 100 years ?

244
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,600
Senior Greed,

245
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,640
how much longer must you recover ?

246
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,920
Nephew Chen Long,

247
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,520
this old man...

248
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,120
That Mosquito Beast is unstoppable.

249
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:02,840
This time, my foundation has been injured.

250
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:05,640
It's not something that ordinary pills can heal.

251
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,120
Without proper recovery,

252
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:11,120
I fear my cultivation might drop.

253
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:12,640
I'm afraid that...

254
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,680
it will take another few decades

255
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:19,920
to barely suppress my injuries.

256
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:34,920
What's attracting it ?

257
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,400
Senior,

258
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,810
Your Divine Sense can probe through this mist.

259
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,450
Could you take a look ?

260
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,240
It seems that

261
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:46,530
a swarm of beasts has gathered at the exit.

262
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:49,240
But I can't see clearly through the mist.

263
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,530
There also seems to be

264
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,600
6 people trapped at the exit.

265
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,200
One old

266
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,640
and 5 young.

267
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:01,800
Those outfits

268
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:04,280
look a bit familiar.

269
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:05,760
Senior,

270
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:07,800
can I look through your consciousness ?

271
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,600
It's the Da Lou Sword Sect !

272
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:22,770
Enemies meet on a narrow road.

273
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:25,280
Beasts in front,

274
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,440
and mist behind.

275
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:29,040
It's not the best time to seek revenge.

276
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,400
How about

277
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,840
we leave first ?

278
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,680
According to what Yao Xixue said,

279
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,400
everyone is about to gather in the Tide Abyss

280
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:41,120
to get the token that opens the true Celestial Cave.

281
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,960
Greed will surely be among them.

282
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,680
In Hai Zhu's memory,

283
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,800
I saw that Greed summoned the 12 Swords to the Tide Abyss.

284
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,240
That was already 100 years ago...

285
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,800
The token...

